# Only src/ is preferred-form source (see src/SOURCES.md).  Everything below is
# an upstream binary, a build output, or scratch -- 650 MB of it, against
# ~300 KB of actual source.

# Upstream binaries.  SOURCES.md records the release URLs:
#   rapidwright-*-standalone-lin64.jar  github.com/Xilinx/RapidWright  (2025.2.1)
#   gson-*.jar                          github.com/google/gson         (2.10.1)
lib/*.jar
lib/*.jar.bak*
lib/*.jar.pre*
lib/classes/

# RapidWright device data -- fetched by RapidWright from its own release URL.
data/

# Wire oracle -- regenerate with src/BuildWireOracle.java (recipe in SOURCES.md).
# 2.5 MB of generated binary; committed nowhere so the jar stays the only
# thing a fresh clone has to fetch.
oracle/

# build.sh output: jars and compiled classes.
src/*.jar
src/dev/

# Scratch and bitstreams from unrelated campaigns.
work/
artifacts/
